{"task_id": "HumanEval/51", "solution": "def remove_vowels(text):\n    \"\"\"\n    remove_vowels is a function that takes string and returns string without vowels.\n    >>> remove_vowels('')\n    ''\n    >>> remove_vowels(\"abcdef\\nghijklm\")\n    'bcdf\\nghjklm'\n    >>> remove_vowels('abcdef')\n    'bcdf'\n    >>> remove_vowels('aaaaa')\n    ''\n    >>> remove_vowels('aaBAA')\n    'B'\n    >>> remove_vowels('zbcd')\n    'zbcd'\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Helper function to check if a character is a vowel (case-insensitive).\n    def _is_vowel(char):\n        return char.lower() in 'aeiou'\n\n    # Helper function to check if a string contains exclusively vowel characters.\n    def _contains_only_vowels(text_val):\n        return all(_is_vowel(char) for char in text_val)\n\n    # Helper function to check if a string contains no vowel characters.\n    def _contains_no_vowels(text_val):\n        return all(not _is_vowel(char) for char in text_val)\n\n    if not text:\n        return ''\n\n    if _contains_only_vowels(text):\n        return ''\n\n    if _contains_no_vowels(text):\n        return text\n\n    result = []\n    for char in text:\n        if not _is_vowel(char):\n            result.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
