{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "def fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\"\"\"\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        a, b = 1, 1  # Initialize with F(1) and F(2)\n        for _ in range(3, n + 1): # Iterate from the 3rd number up to n\n            a, b = b, a + b\n        return b"}
